@description Reapertips Theme (Classroom Modified)
@version 1.1
@author Alejandro Hernandez (Reapertips)
@provides ClassroomTheme.ReaperThemeZip
@links
  Original Reapertips Theme https://www.reapertips.com/products/reapertips-theme
  Reapertips Website https://www.reapertips.com
@donation https://www.reapertips.com/support
@about
  Based on the Reapertips Theme created by Alejandro Hernandez,
  which is itself based on the default REAPER 6 theme.

  This version includes minor modifications for classroom use,
  primarily to accommodate custom REAPER controls and workflows.

  All credit for the original theme and its design belongs to
  Alejandro Hernandez.

  This is an unofficial classroom modification and is not
  an official Reapertips release.

  Please visit the original author's website and consider
  supporting his work.
